flowchart LR
    U[User] --> APP[Application]
    APP --> AI[AI provider]
    AI --> INF[Inference infrastructure]
    AI --> ST[Temporary result / storage]

    ATT[External attacker] -.-> APP
    ATT -.-> AI
    ATT -.-> ST
    INS[Compromised account or insider] -.-> AI
    SUP[Supply-chain compromise] -.-> INF
